OL,4,BZverev to defend himself against fresh 
OL,5,Blawsuit                                
OL,6,GLawyers for world number one Alexander 
OL,7,GZverev say he will defend himself      
OL,8,Gagainst a lawsuit which alleges he     
OL,9,Gmisrepresented the outcome of his      
OL,10,Gdomestic abuse trial.                  
OL,12,FFormer partner Brenda Patea is seeking 
OL,13,Fdamages and an injunction against him  
OL,14,Fmaking similar comments in future.     
OL,16,FIn October 2023 Zverev was issued with 
OL,17,Fa penalty order for bodily harm        
OL,18,Fagainst Patea, with whom he has a      
OL,19,Fdaughter.                              
